WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.540
My niece Kim, she ended up owning the land where my grandmother and grandfather lived.

2
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.840
And dedicated it . . . or donated it for the church.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.080
Which church?

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.120
Mossville Truth.

5
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.520
Who has now moved to Lake Charles.

6
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.380
Is that Mossville Truth Tabernacle?

7
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.200
Right.

8
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:25.900
We were there . . . That church was built on my grandmother and grandfather's property that Kim donated for the church.

9
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:31.940
And another thing about that place, we always said it would be a holy grounds.

10
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:41.260
Holy, holy because that's what my grandmother said her place would always be a place to feed hungry or . . . Because that's what they did.

11
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:53.800
And when my pastor was getting ready to demo [demolish] to make ready to build a church, my grandmother and grandfather’s house was [crying] still standing.

12
00:00:53.800 --> 00:01:00.420
And he had trucks that was to come and tear down and haul it off.

13
00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:04.640
And that man paced up and down and he couldn't.

14
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.120
He paid those guys, the truckers, he paid them.

15
00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.600
He said, "Y’all go ahead on I'm going . . . I got to make another decision."

16
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.320
And he told me he said, "I can't tear this house down.

17
00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.240
I can't let it leave."

18
00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.100
He went and rented a machine and dug a hole.

19
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.420
My grandmother's house is still there.

20
00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:24.120
He would not let them haul it off.

21
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.120
He said, "Not a nail from this house is going to leave."

22
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.200
So he buried it.

23
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.500
So the holy ground is yet still there.

24
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.080
I don't know what Sasol is going to do.

25
00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.740
Somebody might get saved over there. [laughs]
